<%
  ttl = Devise.reset_password_within || 1.hour
  valid_for = email_duration_label(ttl)
  expires_at = (@resource.reset_password_sent_at || Time.current) + ttl
  expires_at_label = email_expiration_timestamp(expires_at)
%>
<% content_for :email_footer_note, "This password reset link expires in #{valid_for}. If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email." %>
RESET YOUR PASSWORD

Hello <%= @resource.email %>,

We received a request to reset the password for your Tax Form Hub account.

Link Valid For: <%= valid_for %>
Expires At: <%= expires_at_label %>

Open the link below to create a new password:
<%= edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

Expiration & Security Notice:
This link will expire in <%= valid_for %> (<%= expires_at_label %>). If it expires before you use it, you can request a new reset link from the sign-in page.
If you didn't request this link, please ignore this email—your password will not change.
